2026-10-28T16:56:22.9395463Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WMwzFpVWjW5VwvZ59HuWiX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 5,\n    \"title\": \"aws_cognito_user_pool: invite_message_template without sms_message sends an empty SMSMessage and UpdateUserPool fails\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": []\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-10-20T12:30:21+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Report a Bug\",\n    \"missing_required\": [],\n    \"empty_optional\": [],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_cognito_user_pool\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/cognitoidp\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"regex_labeler_would_apply\": [\n      \"service/cognitoidp\"\n    ],\n    \"primary_service_label\": \"service/cognitoidp\"\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"terraform\": \"1.15.9\",\n    \"provider\": \"6.66.0\",\n    \"latest_release\": \"6.69.1\",\n    \"latest_release_date\": \"2026-10-15\",\n    \"provider_status\": \"current\",\n    \"minor_releases_behind\": 3,\n    \"newer_release_notes\": [],\n    \"newer_fixes\": []\n  },\n  \"similar_issues\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": 49203,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#49203\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: aws_cognito_user_pool sends an empty InviteMessageTemplate.SMSMessage, making the documented-Optional sms_message effectively required\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"- aws_cognito_user_pool, argument admin_create_user_config.invite_message_template (all three of sms_message, email_message, email_subject) sms_message, email_message, and email_subject are all documented as Optional. When one is omitted, the provider should omit the corresponding field from the CreateUserPool / UpdateUserPool request, so a pool that only sends email invites can be created with ju\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T15:25:35Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.56,\n      \"band\": \"likely\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 32607,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#32607\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: Cognito SMS message character limit\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.4.6 4.63.0 * aws_cognito_user_pool - > The maximum length for the message, including the authentication code, is 140 UTF-8 characters. According to the above page, it is expected that you can enter up to 140 characters. Actually you can only enter 140 bytes. shell \\u2502 Error: \\\"sms_authentication_message\\\" cannot be longer than 140 characters \\u2502 \\u2502 with module.cognito.aws_cognito_user_pool.user_pool, \\u2502\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2023-07-20T00:48:47Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.222,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 28294,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#28294\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: Cognito pool can't update SMS configuration when phone verification is enabled\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.2.8 4.46.0 * aws_cognito_user_pool Attempting to create a pool with SMS phone verification and rotate random external_id every time it's redeployed instead of hardcoding. Each deploy after initial should change the external_id value on the pool and the policy allowing SMS sending. External_id is properly updated when a pool only has email as a verified attribute Modifying the pool configuration \",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"not_planned\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2022-12-12T12:22:01Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.208,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 41131,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#41131\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: Referencing aws_cognito_user_pool.domain requires two runs of apply\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.10.5 5.84.0 aws_cognito_user_pool When creating a pool and a pool domain in the same apply, the pool.domain attribute should be set. When creating a pool and a pool domain in the same apply, the pool.domain attribute is empty. From : hcl variable \\\"region\\\" { description = \\\"Which AWS region to use\\\" type = string default = \\\"us-east-2\\\" } variable \\\"user_mail_address\\\" { description = \\\"Email address of\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-01-29T00:22:05Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.166,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 38096,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#38096\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: Cognito User Pool: cannot modify or remove schema item\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.3.7 5.55.0 * aws_cognito_user_pool It should be possible to add a custom attribute. # aws_cognito_user_pool.pool will be updated in-place ~ resource \\\"aws_cognito_user_pool\\\" \\\"pool\\\" { id = \\\"eu-north-1_9uEdNybKn\\\" name = \\\"tst_user_pool\\\" tags = {} # (10 unchanged attributes hidden) + schema { + attribute_data_type = \\\"String\\\" + mutable = false + name = \\\"custom:test\\\" + required = false + string_attribu\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"not_planned\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2024-06-24T13:39:45Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.165,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"corpus_size\": 11853,\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"likely\": 0.4,\n    \"possible\": 0.28\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ac8c3e1c-998e-40c1-bfb4-2830836ba3ca","uuid":"9bac97c6-d5c1-429c-bbf0-624d697d8e33","timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:56:22.927Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 5,\n    \"title\": \"aws_cognito_user_pool: invite_message_template without sms_message sends an empty SMSMessage and UpdateUserPool fails\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": []\n  