m length for the message, including the authentication code, is 140 UTF-8 characters. According to the above page, it is expected that you can enter up to 140 characters. Actually you can only enter 140 bytes. shell \\u2502 Error: \\\"sms_authentication_message\\\" cannot be longer than 140 characters \\u2502 \\u2502 with module.cognito.aws_cognito_user_pool.user_pool, \\u2502\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2023-07-20T00:48:47Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.222,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 28294,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#28294\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: Cognito pool can't update SMS configuration when phone verification is enabled\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.2.8 4.46.0 * aws_cognito_user_pool Attempting to create a pool with SMS phone verification and rotate random external_id every time it's redeployed instead of hardcoding. Each deploy after initial should change the external_id value on the pool and the policy allowing SMS sending. External_id is properly updated when a pool only has email as a verified attribute Modifying the pool configuration \",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"not_planned\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2022-12-12T12:22:01Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.208,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 41131,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#41131\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: Referencing aws_cognito_user_pool.domain requires two runs of apply\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.10.5 5.84.0 aws_cognito_user_pool When creating a pool and a pool domain in the same apply, the pool.domain attribute should be set. When creating a pool and a pool domain in the same apply, the pool.domain attribute is empty. From : hcl variable \\\"region\\\" { description = \\\"Which AWS region to use\\\" type = string default = \\\"us-east-2\\\" } variable \\\"user_mail_address\\\" { description = \